3466
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:04,510
<i>When I do, I will not apologize.</i><i></i>

3467
00:23:04,510 --> 00:23:06,290
<i>I just have to act like normal.</i>

3468
00:23:06,290 --> 00:23:11,200
<i>You see, I've discovered the secret technique 
to make sure I never lose at interpersonal relationships.</i><i></i>

3469
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:14,130
<i>And that's to exasperate them 
into giving up.</i><i></i>

3470
00:23:14,130 --> 00:23:16,840
<i>A baby can mess up all it wants 
and no one complains.</i>

3471
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:18,170
<i>It's pretty much like that.</i><i></i>

3472
00:23:18,540 --> 00:23:20,600
<i>But I tread very carefully.</i>

3473
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:21,790
<i>Why?</i>

3474
00:23:21,790 --> 00:23:25,500
<i>Because, while I am the victor, 
I'm simultaneously the loser.</i><i></i>

3475
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:37,000
Boss! I found something!

